<div class="item">
	<i>This panel runs the reactor unit. The control rods set the heat: raise them to make steam, lower them to cool the core. The feedwater pump keeps the vessel supplied with water: it needs power and takes about ten seconds to spin up or down. Its automation can hold the water level by itself. SCRAM drops every rod at once and locks them until the core has cooled, but the fission products keep heating the core for a long time (residual heat), so the core still needs water after a SCRAM.</i>
</div>
{{if !data.linked}}
<div class='notice'>
	<b>NO LINK TO REACTOR UNIT '{{:data.reactorId}}'</b><br>
	Check that the reactor core is built and has the same unit id.<br><br>
	{{:helper.link('Rescan links', 'refresh', {'action' : 'rescan'})}}
</div>
{{else}}
{{if data.twoCircuit}}
<div class="item">
	<i>Two-circuit plant. The core heats the primary water and never boils it. The main coolant pump drives that water through the steam generators, which boil the clean secondary water into steam for the turbine. If the pump stops, only natural circulation is left: enough for residual heat and low power, not for full power. Keep the steam generators supplied with feedwater.</i>
</div>
{{/if}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Unit:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		<b>{{:data.reactorId}}</b>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Status:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		<div style="float: left; padding: 4px 12px 0 0;">
			<span class='{{:data.statusClass}}'><b>{{:data.status}}</b></span>
		</div>
		{{:helper.link(data.alarmMuted ? 'Alarm muted: unmute' : 'Acknowledge / mute', data.alarmMuted ? 'volume-off' : 'volume-on', {'action' : 'alarm_mute'}, (data.alarmMuted || data.alarmLevel > 0 || data.alarmUnacked) ? null : 'disabled', data.alarmMuted ? 'selected' : null)}}
	</div>
</div>
<style>
	.nsrTile { float: left; width: 23%; margin: 0 1% 5px 0; padding: 6px 2px; text-align: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; border: 1px solid #444444; }
	.nsrT0 { background: #1b1b1b; color: #5c5c5c; }
	.nsrT1 { background: #c9a227; color: #000000; border-color: #f0d060; }
	.nsrT2 { background: #b22222; color: #ffffff; border-color: #ff6060; }
	.nsrBlink { animation: nsrblink 0.9s step-start infinite; -webkit-animation: nsrblink 0.9s step-start infinite; }
	.nsrFirst { display: block; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
	@keyframes nsrblink { 50% { opacity: 0.2; } }
	@-webkit-keyframes nsrblink { 50% { opacity: 0.2; } }
</style>
<div style="clear: both; padding: 4px 0;">
	{{for data.alarmTiles}}
		<div class="nsrTile nsrT{{:value.level}} {{if value.blink}}nsrBlink{{/if}}">
			{{:value.label}}
			{{if value.first}}<span class="nsrFirst">FIRST</span>{{/if}}
		</div>
	{{/for}}
	<div style="clear: both;"></div>
</div>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Armour plates:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{if data.casingsOpen}}
			<span class='average'>{{:data.casingsOpen}} of {{:data.casingsTotal}} REMOVED</span>
		{{else}}
			<span class='good'>all {{:data.casingsTotal}} sealed</span>
		{{/if}}
	</div>
</div>

<h3>Monitoring</h3>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Core temperature:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.displayBar(data.temp, 0, data.tempMax, data.tempClass)}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			{{:data.temp}} C
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Residual heat:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.displayBar(data.decay, 0, data.decayMax, 'average')}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			{{:data.decay}} % of rated power
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Fuel damage:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.displayBar(data.damage, 0, 100, data.damageClass)}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			{{:data.damage}} %
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		{{if data.twoCircuit}}Secondary steam pressure:{{else}}Steam pressure:{{/if}}
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.displayBar(data.pressure, 0, data.pressureMax, data.pressureClass)}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			{{:data.pressure}} bar
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		{{if data.twoCircuit}}Steam generator water (lowest):{{else}}Coolant (water) level:{{/if}}
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.displayBar(data.coolant, 0, 100, data.coolantClass)}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			{{:data.coolant}} %
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Steam production:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:data.steamFlow}} mol/s
	</div>
</div>
{{if !data.twoCircuit}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Steam port:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{if data.hasPort}}
			<span class='good'>connected to the pipes</span>
		{{else}}
			<span class='average'>none, sealed test vessel</span>
		{{/if}}
	</div>
</div>
{{/if}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Feedwater pump:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{if data.hasPump}}
			<span class='{{:data.pumpClass}}'><b>{{:data.pumpState}}</b></span>
			, rotor {{:data.pumpSpin}}, {{:data.pumpFlow}} mol/s, feed line {{:data.feedPressure}} bar
		{{else}}
			<span class='average'>none, free water valve</span>
		{{/if}}
	</div>
</div>
{{if data.twoCircuit}}
<h3>Primary circuit</h3>
{{if data.leaking}}
<div class='notice'>
	<b>PRIMARY LEAK.</b> The vessel is cracked and loses water while it has pressure. Cool it below 60 C, let the pressure drop below 5 bar and weld the crack.
</div>
{{/if}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Primary pressure:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{if data.hasPzr}}
			{{:helper.displayBar(data.primaryPressure, 0, data.primaryBurst, data.primaryPressureClass)}}
			<div class="statusValue">
				{{:data.primaryPressure}} bar
			</div>
			{{if data.primaryBurstNow < data.primaryBurst}}
				<div class='bad' style="clear: both;">Hot metal: the vessel bursts at {{:data.primaryBurstNow}} bar now.</div>
			{{/if}}
		{{else}}
			{{:data.primaryPressure}} bar <i>(fixed: no pressurizer)</i>
		{{/if}}
	</div>
</div>
{{if data.hasPzr}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Pressurizer level:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.displayBar(data.pzrLevel, 0, 100, data.pzrLevelClass)}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			{{:data.pzrLevel}} %
			{{if data.pzrSolid}}
				<span class='bad'><b>SOLID WATER</b></span>
			{{/if}}
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Heaters / spray:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		<span class='{{:data.pzrHeaterClass}}'><b>{{:data.pzrHeaterText}}</b></span>, heating {{:data.pzrHeating}} %, spray {{:data.pzrSpray}} %
	</div>
</div>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Relief valve:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		<span class='{{:data.pzrReliefClass}}'><b>{{:data.pzrRelief}}</b></span>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Primary water:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:data.inventory}} % of the full amount
		{{if data.voiding}}
			<br><span class='bad'><b>COOLING LOST: {{:data.coolEff}} % (steam in the core or too little water)</b></span>
		{{/if}}
	</div>
</div>
{{/if}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Primary flow:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.displayBar(data.primaryFlow, 0, 100, 'good')}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			{{:data.primaryFlow}} %
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Main coolant pump:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{if data.hasPrimaryPump}}
			<span class='{{:data.ppClass}}'><b>{{:data.ppState}}</b></span>, rotor {{:data.ppSpin}} %, {{:data.ppRpm}} rpm
			<div style="clear: both;">Bearing wear: <span class='{{:data.ppWearClass}}'>{{:data.ppWear}} %</span>{{if data.ppSeized}} <span class='bad'>(rotor jammed: stop the reactor, replace the bearings on site)</span>{{/if}}</div>
		{{else}}
			<span class='bad'>none: natural circulation only</span>
		{{/if}}
	</div>
</div>
<h3>Steam generators</h3>
{{for data.sgList}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Generator {{:value.n}}:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		<span class='{{:value.stateClass}}'><b>{{:value.state}}</b></span>
		{{:helper.displayBar(value.level, 0, 100, value.levelClass)}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			water {{:value.level}} %
		</div>
		<div style="clear: both; padding-top: 2px;">
			{{:value.heat}} heat/s taken from the primary, {{:value.flow}} mol/s of steam, {{:value.pressure}} bar
		</div>
		{{if !value.ruptured}}
		<div style="clear: both; padding-top: 2px;">
			Tubes: <span class='{{:value.tubeClass}}'><b>{{:value.tube}}</b></span>, damage {{:value.tubeDamage}} %{{if value.tube == 'LEAKING'}}, leak {{:value.leakRate}} % of the primary water per second{{/if}}{{if value.plugged > 0}}, {{:value.plugged}} % plugged{{/if}}{{if value.contam > 0}}, <span class='average'>contamination {{:value.contam}}</span>{{/if}}
		</div>
		{{if value.valveClosed}}
		<div class='average' style="clear: both; padding-top: 2px;">
			Valve closed: the water keeps boiling into steam that stays inside, so the water level falls and the pressure rises until the valve is opened.
		</div>
		{{/if}}
		<div style="clear: both; padding-top: 4px;">
			{{:helper.link(value.valveClosed ? 'Steam valve: CLOSED' : 'Steam valve: open', null, {'action' : 'sg_valve', 'n' : value.n}, null, value.valveClosed ? 'redButton' : null)}}
		</div>
		{{/if}}
	</div>
</div>
{{/for}}
{{/if}}

<h3>Controls</h3>
{{if data.dead}}
<div class='notice'>
	<b>REACTOR LOST. NO CONTROL POSSIBLE.</b>
</div>
{{else}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		All rods:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.displayBar(data.rods, 0, 100, 'good')}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			{{:data.rods}} %
			{{if data.rodsMoving}}
				<span class='average'>average target {{:data.rodsTarget}} %</span>
			{{/if}}
		</div>
		<div style="clear: both; padding-top: 4px;">
			{{:helper.link('-10', null, {'action' : 'rods_move', 'amount' : -10}, (data.rodsTarget > 0) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('-1', null, {'action' : 'rods_move', 'amount' : -1}, (data.rodsTarget > 0) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('+1', null, {'action' : 'rods_move', 'amount' : 1}, (data.scrammed || data.rodsTarget >= 100) ? 'disabled' : null)}}
			{{:helper.link('+10', null, {'action' : 'rods_move', 'amount' : 10}, (data.scrammed || data.rodsTarget >= 100) ? 'disabled' : null)}}
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
{{for data.rodList}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Rod {{:value.n}}:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.displayBar(value.pos, 0, 100, 'good')}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			{{:value.pos}} %
			{{if value.moving}}
				<span class='average'>moving to {{:value.target}} %</span>
			{{/if}}
		</div>
		<div style="clear: both; padding-top: 4px;">
			{{:helper.link('-10', null, {'action' : 'rod_move', 'rod' : value.n, 'amount' : -10}, (value.target > 0) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('-1', null, {'action' : 'rod_move', 'rod' : value.n, 'amount' : -1}, (value.target > 0) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('+1', null, {'action' : 'rod_move', 'rod' : value.n, 'amount' : 1}, (value.locked || value.target >= 100) ? 'disabled' : null)}}
			{{:helper.link('+10', null, {'action' : 'rod_move', 'rod' : value.n, 'amount' : 10}, (value.locked || value.target >= 100) ? 'disabled' : null)}}
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
{{/for}}
{{if data.hasPump}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Feedwater pump:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		<svg width="150" height="125" viewBox="0 0 120 100">
			<circle cx="60" cy="60" r="40" fill="none" stroke="#3a3a3a" stroke-width="9" stroke-dasharray="188.5 400" transform="rotate(135 60 60)"/>
			<circle cx="60" cy="60" r="40" fill="none" stroke-width="9" stroke-dasharray="{{:data.pumpFillLen}} 400" transform="rotate(135 60 60)" stroke="{{if data.pumpClass == 'good'}}#4caf50{{else}}{{if data.pumpClass == 'average'}}#d9a82b{{else}}#c0392b{{/if}}{{/if}}">
				<animate attributeName="stroke-dasharray" from="{{:data.pumpFillPrev}} 400" to="{{:data.pumpFillLen}} 400" dur="2s" fill="freeze" calcMode="spline" keyTimes="0;1" keySplines="0.3 0 0.2 1"/>
			</circle>
			<line x1="60" y1="9" x2="60" y2="16" stroke="#f0c040" stroke-width="3" transform="rotate({{:data.pumpTargetAngle}} 60 60)"/>
			<line x1="60" y1="60" x2="60" y2="26" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" transform="rotate({{:data.pumpAngle}} 60 60)">
				<animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="rotate" from="{{:data.pumpAnglePrev}} 60 60" to="{{:data.pumpAngle}} 60 60" dur="2s" fill="freeze" calcMode="spline" keyTimes="0;1" keySplines="0.3 0 0.2 1"/>
			</line>
			<circle cx="60" cy="60" r="5" fill="#dddddd"/>
			<text x="60" y="86" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffffff">{{:data.pumpRpm}}</text>
			<text x="60" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#aaaaaa">rpm</text>
		</svg>
		<div>
			Rotor: <b>{{:data.pumpSpin}}</b>
		</div>
		<div>
			Motor heat:
			{{:helper.displayBar(data.pumpHeat, 0, 100, data.pumpHeatClass)}}
			<div class="statusValue">
				{{:data.pumpHeat}}
			</div>
		</div>
		{{if data.pumpBurnt}}
			<div class='bad' style="clear: both;">
				<b>MOTOR BURNT OUT.</b> Let it cool, then rewind it with cable.
			</div>
		{{else}}
			{{if data.pumpHeat >= 60}}
				<div class='bad' style="clear: both;">
					Motor overheating. Check that the pump has water to pump.
				</div>
			{{/if}}
		{{/if}}
		{{:helper.displayBar(data.pumpSpeed, 0, 100, 'good')}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			set {{:data.pumpSpeed}} %
		</div>
		<div style="clear: both; padding-top: 4px;">
			{{:helper.link('-10', null, {'action' : 'pump_move', 'amount' : -10}, (!data.pumpAuto && data.pumpSpeed > 0) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('-1', null, {'action' : 'pump_move', 'amount' : -1}, (!data.pumpAuto && data.pumpSpeed > 0) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('+1', null, {'action' : 'pump_move', 'amount' : 1}, (!data.pumpAuto && data.pumpSpeed < 100) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('+10', null, {'action' : 'pump_move', 'amount' : 10}, (!data.pumpAuto && data.pumpSpeed < 100) ? null : 'disabled')}}
		</div>
		<div style="clear: both; padding-top: 6px;">
			Automation:
			{{if data.pumpAuto}}
				<span class='good'><b>ON</b></span>, holds the water level at <b>{{:data.pumpAutoSet}} %</b>
			{{else}}
				<span class='average'><b>OFF</b></span> (manual speed)
			{{/if}}
			{{if data.pumpAutoText}}
				<div class='average'>{{:data.pumpAutoText}}</div>
			{{/if}}
			<div style="padding-top: 4px;">
				{{:helper.link(data.pumpAuto ? 'Switch off' : 'Switch on', null, {'action' : 'pump_auto'}, data.pumpBurnt ? 'disabled' : null, data.pumpAuto ? 'selected' : null)}}
				<div style="float: left; padding: 4px 8px 0 8px;">level:</div>
				{{:helper.link('-5', null, {'action' : 'pump_auto_set', 'amount' : -5}, (data.pumpAutoSet > 10) ? null : 'disabled')}}
				{{:helper.link('-1', null, {'action' : 'pump_auto_set', 'amount' : -1}, (data.pumpAutoSet > 10) ? null : 'disabled')}}
				{{:helper.link('+1', null, {'action' : 'pump_auto_set', 'amount' : 1}, (data.pumpAutoSet < 95) ? null : 'disabled')}}
				{{:helper.link('+5', null, {'action' : 'pump_auto_set', 'amount' : 5}, (data.pumpAutoSet < 95) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
{{else}}
{{if data.twoCircuit}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Feedwater pump:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		<span class='bad'>none: the steam generators get no water</span>
	</div>
</div>
{{else}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Feedwater valve:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.displayBar(data.feedwater, 0, 100, 'good')}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			{{:data.feedwater}} %
		</div>
		<div style="clear: both; padding-top: 4px;">
			{{:helper.link('Close -10', 'triangle-1-s', {'action' : 'feed_down'}, (data.feedwater > 0) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('Open +10', 'triangle-1-n', {'action' : 'feed_up'}, (data.feedwater < 100) ? null : 'disabled')}}
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
{{/if}}
{{/if}}
{{if data.twoCircuit && data.hasPrimaryPump}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Main coolant pump:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.displayBar(data.ppSpeed, 0, 100, 'good')}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			set {{:data.ppSpeed}} %
		</div>
		<div style="clear: both; padding-top: 4px;">
			{{:helper.link('-10', null, {'action' : 'ppump_move', 'amount' : -10}, (data.ppSpeed > 0) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('-1', null, {'action' : 'ppump_move', 'amount' : -1}, (data.ppSpeed > 0) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('+1', null, {'action' : 'ppump_move', 'amount' : 1}, (data.ppSpeed < 100) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('+10', null, {'action' : 'ppump_move', 'amount' : 10}, (data.ppSpeed < 100) ? null : 'disabled')}}
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
{{/if}}
{{if data.twoCircuit && data.hasPzr}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Pressure automation:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{if data.pzrAuto}}
			<span class='good'><b>ON</b></span>, holds <b>{{:data.pzrSet}} bar</b>
		{{else}}
			<span class='average'><b>OFF</b></span> (heaters and spray by hand)
		{{/if}}
		<div style="clear: both; padding-top: 4px;">
			{{:helper.link(data.pzrAuto ? 'Switch off' : 'Switch on', null, {'action' : 'pzr_auto'}, null, data.pzrAuto ? 'selected' : null)}}
			<div style="float: left; padding: 4px 8px 0 8px;">setpoint:</div>
			{{:helper.link('-5', null, {'action' : 'pzr_set', 'amount' : -5})}}
			{{:helper.link('-1', null, {'action' : 'pzr_set', 'amount' : -1})}}
			{{:helper.link('+1', null, {'action' : 'pzr_set', 'amount' : 1})}}
			{{:helper.link('+5', null, {'action' : 'pzr_set', 'amount' : 5})}}
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Heaters:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.displayBar(data.pzrHeater, 0, 100, 'good')}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			set {{:data.pzrHeater}} %
		</div>
		<div style="clear: both; padding-top: 4px;">
			{{:helper.link('-10', null, {'action' : 'pzr_heater', 'amount' : -10}, data.pzrAuto ? 'disabled' : null)}}
			{{:helper.link('-1', null, {'action' : 'pzr_heater', 'amount' : -1}, data.pzrAuto ? 'disabled' : null)}}
			{{:helper.link('+1', null, {'action' : 'pzr_heater', 'amount' : 1}, data.pzrAuto ? 'disabled' : null)}}
			{{:helper.link('+10', null, {'action' : 'pzr_heater', 'amount' : 10}, data.pzrAuto ? 'disabled' : null)}}
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Spray:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.displayBar(data.pzrSpray, 0, 100, 'good')}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			set {{:data.pzrSpray}} %
		</div>
		<div style="clear: both; padding-top: 4px;">
			{{:helper.link('-10', null, {'action' : 'pzr_spray', 'amount' : -10}, data.pzrAuto ? 'disabled' : null)}}
			{{:helper.link('-1', null, {'action' : 'pzr_spray', 'amount' : -1}, data.pzrAuto ? 'disabled' : null)}}
			{{:helper.link('+1', null, {'action' : 'pzr_spray', 'amount' : 1}, data.pzrAuto ? 'disabled' : null)}}
			{{:helper.link('+10', null, {'action' : 'pzr_spray', 'amount' : 10}, data.pzrAuto ? 'disabled' : null)}}
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Relief valve:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.link(data.pzrReliefManual ? 'Close' : 'Open by hand', null, {'action' : 'pzr_relief'}, data.pzrBlock ? 'disabled' : null, data.pzrReliefManual ? 'selected' : null)}}
		{{:helper.link(data.pzrBlock ? 'Block valve: CLOSED' : 'Block valve: open', null, {'action' : 'pzr_block'}, null, data.pzrBlock ? 'selected' : null)}}
	</div>
</div>
{{/if}}
{{if data.twoCircuit && data.hasMakeup}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Makeup pump:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		<span class='{{:data.mkClass}}'><b>{{:data.mkState}}</b></span>, set {{:data.mkSetting}} % (minus drains)
		<div style="clear: both; padding-top: 4px;">
			{{:helper.link('-10', null, {'action' : 'makeup_move', 'amount' : -10}, (data.mkSetting > -100) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('-1', null, {'action' : 'makeup_move', 'amount' : -1}, (data.mkSetting > -100) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('Stop', null, {'action' : 'makeup_stop'}, (data.mkSetting != 0) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('+1', null, {'action' : 'makeup_move', 'amount' : 1}, (data.mkSetting < 100) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('+10', null, {'action' : 'makeup_move', 'amount' : 10}, (data.mkSetting < 100) ? null : 'disabled')}}
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
{{/if}}
{{if !data.hasPort}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Steam valve:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.displayBar(data.steamValve, 0, 100, 'good')}}
		<div class="statusValue">
			{{:data.steamValve}} %
		</div>
		<div style="clear: both; padding-top: 4px;">
			{{:helper.link('Close -10', 'triangle-1-s', {'action' : 'steam_down'}, (data.steamValve > 0) ? null : 'disabled')}}
			{{:helper.link('Open +10', 'triangle-1-n', {'action' : 'steam_up'}, (data.steamValve < 100) ? null : 'disabled')}}
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
{{/if}}
<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Emergency:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.link('SCRAM', 'alert', {'action' : 'scram'}, data.scrammed ? 'disabled' : null, 'redButton')}}
		{{:helper.link('Reset SCRAM', 'unlocked', {'action' : 'reset'}, data.scrammed ? null : 'disabled')}}
		{{if data.scrammed}}
			<span class='bad'>&nbsp;SCRAM ENGAGED, rods locked</span>
		{{/if}}
	</div>
</div>
{{/if}}

<div class="item">
	<div class="itemLabel">
		Link:
	</div>
	<div class="itemContent">
		{{:helper.link('Rescan links', 'refresh', {'action' : 'rescan'})}}
	</div>
</div>
{{/if}}
